# Local harness / roster infrastructure — not part of the published repo.
#
# These are per-workstation roster installs: agent definitions, hooks, skill
# prose and the KB. They are regenerated by `/recruit` + the roster installer
# and carry machine-local state, so they are deliberately NOT tracked here.
#
# NOTE — this is the *opposite* of the deterministic review-tool bundle under
# scripts/ + schema/ + tools/data-schema/, which IS tracked (see
# scripts/REVIEW-BUNDLE.md). Those files are the quality gates themselves; a
# fresh clone must get them or the project has no gates at all. Do not add
# bundle paths here. `scripts/check-review-bundle-tracked.sh` enforces that.
.agents/
.harness/
skills-meta/
kb/
docs/team-proposal-2026-05-29.md

# Roster runtime install directories (machine-local, installed by /recruit).
/roster/
/skills/
/workflows/
/dist/
/.codex/

# Local branch-reconciliation scratch spec (not a published spec)
/specs/main-master-reconcile.md

# Per-agent scratchpad namespaces created by scripts/agent-worktree-bootstrap.sh
.agent-scratch/

# Playwright MCP session artifacts
.playwright-mcp/
